<title>UK: Rabobank adds 50 bln lire to fix/rev FRN.</title>
<headline>Rabobank adds 50 bln lire to fix/rev FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager Credito Italiano, has been increased to 250 billion lire from 200 billion lire.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK NEDERLAND</p>
<p> AMT    250 BLN ITL   COUPON   **10 PCT    MATURITY  **06.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.05    PAY DATE    06.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.375    SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	**FOR YEARS 1-3 THEN 19.5 PCT LESS (2 X 6M LIBOR)</p>
<p>		IF NOT CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
